license: LicenseRef-PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
abstract: >-
  A small Python toolkit for lexical frequency profiling of texts,
  measuring how much of a text's vocabulary falls into common vs.
  rare/unknown frequency bands relative to a corpus- or list-derived
  reference frequency model.
